    "The first standalone fixture lacked its private pasteboard service; the native-field portion of startup could not contact GPBS. The corrected fixture owns a real storage service.",
    "The compositor control pointer command accepts integer coordinates. Test points now round measured native item centers before sending them.",
    "A native submenu is an xdg popup, not a second toplevel. Native visibility and the compositor popup query establish its actual mapping.",
    "A compositor input acknowledgment precedes native menu hit testing. The fixture waits for the actual native leaf highlight before releasing.",
    "Keeping a focused native field alive exposed normal AppKit key-window restoration mapping its private backing. The final backing host denies ordering; the final test rejects competing field input during tracking and observes no extra window after the menu hides.",
    "An earlier Firefox diagnostic failed a native application clipboard roundtrip, then passed 83 checks on retry. A fresh final cohort passed all 83 on its first run. Rapid clipboard focus/owner lifetime behavior remains unqualified.",
    "A provider was rebuilt while two owned diagnostic browser instances still had it loaded. Those cohorts were stopped; all final qualification used fresh processes and an immutable separate menu-final-build directory."
  ],
